  "releaseNotes": "v5.2.38: on SpawnDev.ILGPU 5.2.25 + SpawnDev.SpawnJS 2.1.20 - the uncaptured WebGPU forward is ~10-30x faster (DAv3 Small 518: 3.2 s -> ~100 ms, DAv2 285 -> ~60 ms): Einsum on the GPU, readbacks only for values a host slot needs, submit-only drains, input-independent node folding. See CHANGELOG.md.",
